<style>
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: stretch; margin: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-4); }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback input[type="radio"] { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }

  /* ── mobile cards ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-title {
    font-family: IM Fell English, serif; font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-md); margin: 0 0 var(--s-1) 0;
    color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-1);
    list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards label {
    display: block; padding: var(--s-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--muted-2); border-radius: 2px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 200ms, background 200ms;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards label:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards .card-head {
    font-family: EB Garamond, serif; font-size: var(--fs-md);
    margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: var(--ink);
    display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--s-2); flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards .card-sub {
    font-family: IM Fell English, serif; font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards .card-tag {
    font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--accent-text); font-style: normal;
  }

  /* ── card active states ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r1:checked) .card-1 label {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r2:checked) .card-2 label {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r3:checked) .card-3 label {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r4:checked) .card-4 label {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
  }

  /* ── desktop ≥720px: show SVG, hide HTML cards ─────────────── */
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback svg.diagram { display: none; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback svg.diagram { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 880px; }
    .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-title { display: none; }
    .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .stack-cards { display: none; }
  }

  /* ── SVG layer styles ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .layer {
    fill: var(--bg-soft); stroke: var(--muted-2); stroke-width: 1.5; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .layer-text {
    pointer-events: none; font-family: EB Garamond, serif; font-size: 15px; fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .layer-sub {
    pointer-events: none; font-family: IM Fell English, serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; fill: var(--muted);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .layer-tag {
    pointer-events: none; font-family: JetBrains Mono, monospace; font-size: 11px; fill: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .arrow { stroke: var(--muted-2); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; marker-end: url(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-arrow); }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .diagram-head {
    font-family: IM Fell English, serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; fill: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* SVG layer active states */
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r1:checked) .layer-1 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, var(--bg-soft)); stroke: var(--accent); }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r2:checked) .layer-2 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, var(--bg-soft)); stroke: var(--accent); }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r3:checked) .layer-3 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, var(--bg-soft)); stroke: var(--accent); }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r4:checked) .layer-4 { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, var(--bg-soft)); stroke: var(--accent); }

  /* ── detail panel ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .hint {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: var(--fs-xs); color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-1); letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .detail {
    padding: var(--s-2) var(--s-3); border-left: 2px solid var(--accent); display: none;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .detail h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-1); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback .detail p {
    margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r1:checked) .detail-1 { display: block; }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r2:checked) .detail-2 { display: block; }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r3:checked) .detail-3 { display: block; }
  .vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback:has(#vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r4:checked) .detail-4 { display: block; }
</style>

<figure class="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback">
  <input type="radio" id="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r1" name="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-sel" checked aria-label="L1 應用層" />
  <input type="radio" id="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r2" name="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-sel" aria-label="L2 傳輸層" />
  <input type="radio" id="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r3" name="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-sel" aria-label="L3 網路層" />
  <input type="radio" id="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r4" name="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-sel" aria-label="L4 連結層" />

  <!-- mobile: HTML cards -->
  <p class="stack-title" id="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-title">網路分層堆疊</p>
  <ul class="stack-cards" aria-labelledby="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-title">
    <li class="card-1"><label for="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r1">
      <p class="card-head"><span>L1 · 應用層</span><code class="card-tag">HTTP / TLS</code></p>
      <p class="card-sub">處理協議語意與資料格式，直接面向使用者程式</p>
    </label></li>
    <li class="card-2"><label for="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r2">
      <p class="card-head"><span>L2 · 傳輸層</span><code class="card-tag">TCP / UDP</code></p>
      <p class="card-sub">端到端可靠傳輸，負責分段、重傳與流量控制</p>
    </label></li>
    <li class="card-3"><label for="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r3">
      <p class="card-head"><span>L3 · 網路層</span><code class="card-tag">IP / ICMP</code></p>
      <p class="card-sub">跨網段路由尋址，決定封包的最佳傳送路徑</p>
    </label></li>
    <li class="card-4"><label for="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-r4">
      <p class="card-head"><span>L4 · 連結層</span><code class="card-tag">Ethernet</code></p>
      <p class="card-sub">同一鏈路上的媒介存取控制與 MAC 位址定址</p>
    </label></li>
  </ul>

  <!-- desktop: SVG diagram (display:none on mobile via CSS) -->
  <svg class="diagram" viewBox="0 0 880 320" role="img" aria-label="網路分層堆疊：應用層、傳輸層、網路層、連結層">
    <defs>
      <marker id="vg-w-demo-stack-cards-svg-fallback-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z" fill="var(--muted-2)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <text x="60" y="22" class="diagram-head">網路分層堆疊 — 點選任一層查看詳細說明</text>

    <!-- L1 應用層 -->
    <rect class="layer layer-1" x="60" y="40" width="760" height="52" rx="3" />
    <text x="80" y="62" class="layer-text">L1 · 應用層</text>
    <text x="80" y="80" class="layer-sub">處理協議語意與資料格式，直接面向使用者程式</text>
    <text x="820" y="71" class="layer-tag" text-anchor="end">HTTP / TLS</text>

    <!-- arrow 1→2 -->
    <line x1="440" y1="92" x2="440" y2="108" class="arrow" />

    <!-- L2 傳輸層 -->
    <rect class="layer layer-2" x="60" y="110" width="760" height="52" rx="3" />
    <text x="80" y="132" class="layer-text">L2 · 傳輸層</text>
    <text x="80" y="150" class="layer-sub">端到端可靠傳輸，負責分段、重傳與流量控制</text>
    <text x="820" y="141" class="layer-tag" text-anchor="end">TCP / UDP</text>

    <!-- arrow 2→3 -->
    <line x1="440" y1="162" x2="440" y2="178" class="arrow" />

    <!-- L3 網路層 -->
    <rect class="layer layer-3" x="60" y="180" width="760" height="52" rx="3" />
    <text x="80" y="202" class="layer-text">L3 · 網路層</text>
    <text x="80" y="220" class="layer-sub">跨網段路由尋址，決定封包的最佳傳送路徑</text>
    <text x="820" y="211" class="layer-tag" text-anchor="end">IP / ICMP</text>

    <!-- arrow 3→4 -->
    <line x1="440" y1="232" x2="440" y2="248" class="arrow" />

    <!-- L4 連結層 -->
    <rect class="layer layer-4" x="60" y="250" width="760" height="52" rx="3" />
    <text x="80" y="272" class="layer-text">L4 · 連結層</text>
    <text x="80" y="290" class="layer-sub">同一鏈路上的媒介存取控制與 MAC 位址定址</text>
    <text x="820" y="281" class="layer-tag" text-anchor="end">Ethernet</text>
  </svg>

  <!-- detail panel (shown at all viewports) -->
  <div>
    <p class="hint">點選任一層查看說明</p>
    <div class="detail detail-1">
      <h3>L1 · 應用層</h3>
      <p>應用層負責定義資料格式與通訊協議語意，例如 HTTP 規範了請求與回應的結構，TLS 在其上提供加密通道。這一層直接與使用者程式互動，是整個堆疊中唯一「看得懂業務意義」的層次。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="detail detail-2">
      <h3>L2 · 傳輸層</h3>
      <p>傳輸層提供端到端的可靠傳輸保證。TCP 透過三次握手建立連線，並以序號、確認號碼與滑動視窗實現重傳與流量控制；UDP 則捨棄可靠性換取低延遲，適用於即時串流或 DNS 查詢。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="detail detail-3">
      <h3>L3 · 網路層</h3>
      <p>網路層以 IP 位址為基礎進行跨網段路由。每個封包獨立選擇路徑，路由器根據路由表轉發，ICMP 則負責傳回錯誤訊息（如 TTL 超時或不可達）。這一層不保證順序或可靠性。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="detail detail-4">
      <h3>L4 · 連結層</h3>
      <p>連結層管理同一實體鏈路上的資料傳輸，以 MAC 位址識別裝置。Ethernet 框架包含前置碼、MAC 來源與目的、承載資料及 CRC 校驗。ARP 負責將 IP 位址解析為對應的 MAC 位址。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>
